{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 3873464,
  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43340802",
      "title": "Adjusting Server Actions for useFormState",
      "lectureOrder": 173,
      "videoOrder": 160,
      "sourceHash": "04c689583ecdb987f70e69a0deecb2025ce8f1e8c8b5181e868aa6e72b7eddbc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.291,
          "end": 3.3,
          "en": "Now, one way of working around,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.3,
          "end": 6.33,
          "en": "and not the only way as you will soon see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.33,
          "end": 10.89,
          "en": "would be to create a new component, a PostForm Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.89,
          "end": 14.163,
          "en": "for example, in a separate post-form.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.96,
          "end": 20.403,
          "en": "Here, I'll create a separate PostForm Component Function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.72,
          "end": 24.09,
          "en": "And the idea behind this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.09,
          "end": 28.023,
          "en": "is to have all that code that includes useFormState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 29.01,
          "end": 30.963,
          "en": "and the rendering of this form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.95,
          "end": 36.95,
          "en": "so that I grab all that code from the NewPostPage JS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 38.76,
          "end": 43.76,
          "en": "and move that into the PostForm Component like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 44.34,
          "end": 46.503,
          "en": "And I need a closing bracket here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 47.58,
          "end": 51.39,
          "en": "So now the PostForm Component has the useFormState hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 51.39,
          "end": 53.883,
          "en": "and all the markup that renders the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 55.44,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "Now, it won't work like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 59.7,
          "en": "For example, the FormSubmit import is missing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 59.7,
          "end": 62.7,
          "en": "and the useFormState hook import is missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 62.7,
          "end": 64.26,
          "en": "And of course, we don't have access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 64.26,
          "end": 66.51,
          "en": "to this createPost action here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 66.51,
          "end": 68.943,
          "en": "so we need to fix these things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 69.87,
          "end": 73.56,
          "en": "And I'll start with the imports in page.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 73.56,
          "end": 76.41,
          "en": "I will actually grab the import of the useFormState hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 76.41,
          "end": 78.36,
          "en": "and remove it from there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.36,
          "end": 80.34,
          "en": "And then actually also remove",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.34,
          "end": 82.59,
          "en": "the Use Client Directive from there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.59,
          "end": 85.68,
          "en": "cut all that and add it here at the top",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.68,
          "end": 87.873,
          "en": "of the PostForm Component file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.06,
          "end": 93.66,
          "en": "And I'll also grab this FormSubmit Component import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.66,
          "end": 96.33,
          "en": "cut it from the NewPostPage file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 96.33,
          "end": 100.053,
          "en": "and add that here in the PostForm JS file instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 102,
          "end": 106.083,
          "en": "Now that form and that hook here is in a separate component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 107.07,
          "end": 109.05,
          "en": "Now that hook needs access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 109.05,
          "end": 111.93,
          "en": "to the createPost Server action though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 111.93,
          "end": 113.28,
          "en": "And what we can do here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.28,
          "end": 116.75999999999999,
          "en": "and what works is that we simply accept that as a Prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.75999999999999,
          "end": 120.57,
          "en": "because you can pass Server Actions through Props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 120.57,
          "end": 124.68,
          "en": "and you can indeed pass them from a React Server Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 124.68,
          "end": 126.87,
          "en": "to a Client Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 126.87,
          "end": 128.91,
          "en": "That works and is allowed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 128.91,
          "end": 132.72,
          "en": "You just can't define them in a Client Component file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.72,
          "end": 136.05,
          "en": "but you can pass them from a Server Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.05,
          "end": 137.46,
          "en": "to a Client Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.46,
          "end": 138.993,
          "en": "And that's what I'll do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.95,
          "end": 141.6,
          "en": "Now, I'll name my prop Action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.6,
          "end": 143.73,
          "en": "and then use that prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.73,
          "end": 146.013,
          "en": "as a value in the useFormState hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.02,
          "end": 152.13,
          "en": "And with that done back here in the page.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.13,
          "end": 155.55,
          "en": "we can and should go down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.55,
          "end": 159.6,
          "en": "and now simply return that PostForm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 159.6,
          "end": 161.61,
          "en": "and set this action prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.61,
          "end": 165.063,
          "en": "to the createPost Server action function like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.55,
          "end": 169.41,
          "en": "And with that, we're now defining",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.41,
          "end": 172.11,
          "en": "that Server Action in a Server Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.11,
          "end": 174.36,
          "en": "which is how it should be.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.36,
          "end": 177.27,
          "en": "And we're then passing it to a Client Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 177.27,
          "end": 178.323,
          "en": "which will work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 179.31,
          "end": 183.12,
          "en": "And now with that, if we do that, you see the error is gone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.12,
          "end": 187.29,
          "en": "and this New Post Page reloads successfully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.29,
          "end": 191.04,
          "en": "You will also see however, that if I now click Create Post,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 191.04,
          "end": 192.99,
          "en": "I'm getting some error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 192.99,
          "end": 194.16,
          "en": "I'm getting some error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.16,
          "end": 197.52,
          "en": "that formData.get is not a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.52,
          "end": 201.3,
          "en": "So that code in my formAction suddenly fails.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.3,
          "end": 204.42000000000002,
          "en": "And previously, it of course, worked fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 204.42000000000002,
          "end": 205.863,
          "en": "Why is that the case?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.76,
          "end": 211.65,
          "en": "Well, the code in this formAction is now failing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 211.65,
          "end": 215.67000000000002,
          "en": "because now, we no longer get formData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 215.67000000000002,
          "end": 218.85,
          "en": "as a first argument in that Server Action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 218.85,
          "end": 220.68,
          "en": "And we're no longer getting that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.68,
          "end": 224.04,
          "en": "because we're funneling this Server Action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 224.04,
          "end": 227.13,
          "en": "through the useFormState hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 227.13,
          "end": 231,
          "en": "We're passing it as a first argument to useFormState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 231,
          "end": 233.94,
          "en": "Now, I mentioned that we get back a new formAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 233.94,
          "end": 235.8,
          "en": "which we can set on the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 235.8,
          "end": 239.52,
          "en": "but React will actually not just listen to the submission",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 239.52,
          "end": 241.41,
          "en": "of the form and update that state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 241.41,
          "end": 244.293,
          "en": "but it will also change the way the formAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 245.163,
          "end": 248.64,
          "en": "the server action we're passing to useFormState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 248.64,
          "end": 249.993,
          "en": "will be called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 251.28,
          "end": 253.95,
          "en": "It will still give us access to the formData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 253.95,
          "end": 258.57,
          "en": "but it will no longer do so as a first argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 258.57,
          "end": 261.75,
          "en": "Instead, the first argument will be the previous",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 261.75,
          "end": 264.24,
          "en": "form state now and the second argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 264.24,
          "end": 265.79,
          "en": "will be the submitted formData.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 267.54,
          "end": 271.92,
          "en": "So if we had more complex logic in our Server Action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 271.92,
          "end": 275.1,
          "en": "where we might want to return a new form state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 275.1,
          "end": 277.56,
          "en": "based on the previous form state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 277.56,
          "end": 281.90999999999997,
          "en": "we could do that with help of that prevState object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 281.90999999999997,
          "end": 283.8,
          "en": "which we get automatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 283.8,
          "end": 287.15999999999997,
          "en": "because we're passing this Server Action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 287.15999999999997,
          "end": 289.71,
          "en": "to the useFormState hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 289.71,
          "end": 292.2,
          "en": "And in our case that, for example, would give us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 292.2,
          "end": 294.3,
          "en": "that initial state object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 294.3,
          "end": 297.303,
          "en": "That's what we could retrieve from prevState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 298.35,
          "end": 299.73,
          "en": "Here, I don't need it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 299.73,
          "end": 301.68,
          "en": "but still this is how we now need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 301.68,
          "end": 304.14,
          "en": "to write this Server Action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 304.14,
          "end": 306.78,
          "en": "because the formData will now actually be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 306.78,
          "end": 308.073,
          "en": "the second argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 309.18,
          "end": 311.76,
          "en": "So with that though, we will be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 311.76,
          "end": 314.46,
          "en": "to click Create Post without getting an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 314.46,
          "end": 317.88,
          "en": "But of course, we now don't get any feedback here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 317.88,
          "end": 321.24,
          "en": "We don't see those error messages we're creating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 321.24,
          "end": 322.773,
          "en": "in our server side code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 324.09,
          "end": 325.41,
          "en": "And the reason for that simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 325.41,
          "end": 328.92,
          "en": "is that we're not using this state yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 328.92,
          "end": 333.36,
          "en": "And keep in mind that this state will be that object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 333.36,
          "end": 335.79,
          "en": "that has this errors property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 335.79,
          "end": 338.73,
          "en": "which stores this errors array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 338.73,
          "end": 339.93,
          "en": "But we're not using that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 339.93,
          "end": 343.26,
          "en": "Hence of course, we're not showing it on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 343.26,
          "end": 347.4,
          "en": "But we can now simply use it here in the PostForm Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 347.4,
          "end": 349.863,
          "en": "to output those error messages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 351.06,
          "end": 353.85,
          "en": "For example, by going to the bottom of this form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 353.85,
          "end": 358.56,
          "en": "and then here we can output those error messages dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 358.56,
          "end": 362.94,
          "en": "by checking if state.errors is defined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 362.94,
          "end": 366.933,
          "en": "So if we have an errors property in the state object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 368.25,
          "end": 369.45,
          "en": "and if that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 369.45,
          "end": 371.79,
          "en": "I wanna output an unordered list here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 371.79,
          "end": 376.08299999999997,
          "en": "which I'll give a className of form-errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 377.55,
          "end": 381.3,
          "en": "And then here inside of that unordered list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 381.3,
          "end": 384.39,
          "en": "I wanna map my errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 384.39,
          "end": 389.39,
          "en": "So my error messages, which are strings, to list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 390.54,
          "end": 392.58,
          "en": "Now every list item will receive a key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 392.58,
          "end": 394.92,
          "en": "which is simply the error message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 394.92,
          "end": 397.11,
          "en": "and then I'll output the error message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 397.11,
          "end": 398.973,
          "en": "between those list item tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 401.07,
          "end": 403.47,
          "en": "Well, and with that, if you saved it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 403.47,
          "end": 408.09000000000003,
          "en": "you should now see those error messages down there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 408.09000000000003,
          "end": 410.67,
          "en": "if you're not submitting any data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 410.67,
          "end": 413.82,
          "en": "Now as you see, I don't get any error regarding the image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 413.82,
          "end": 418.08,
          "en": "even though I haven't added any image here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 418.08,
          "end": 421.02,
          "en": "because indeed image will always be an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 421.02,
          "end": 423.09,
          "en": "even if nothing was submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 423.09,
          "end": 426.51,
